      "item": [
        {
          "id": "7fa170cf-a428-4395-9f24-c8bce425ce83",
          "name": "Login to get the bearer token for protected endpoints",
          "request": {
            "name": "Login to get the bearer token for protected endpoints",
            "description": {
              "content": "TcPCM supports three different login flows:\n1. **Resource Owner Password flow**: Use the *username* and *password* with the *grant\\_type* \"password\" and *authenticatorId* \"Siemens.TCPCM.AuthenticationMethod.TcPCM\" or \"Siemens.TCPCM.AuthenticationMethod.Windows\".\n2. **Token Exchange flow**: Use the *subject\\_token\\_type* and *subject\\_token* with the *grant\\_type* \"urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange\" and *authenticatorId* \"Siemens.TCPCM.AuthenticationMethod.SamAuth\".\n3. **Custom flow**: Use the *tcpcmSessionKey* with the *grant\\_type* \"applicationSession\" without *authenticatorId*.\n\nRefresh token flow:\n* The refresh token can be used to generate a new bearer token without re-authenticating.\n* The *grant\\_type* must be set to \"refresh\\_token\" and the *refresh\\_token* must be provided that was obtained via the initial authentication.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "token"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "password",
                  "description": "(Required) Defines the method obtaining the access token."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "client_id",
                  "value": "TcPCM",
                  "description": "(Required) Uniquely identifies the application making the request for authentication purposes."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "client_secret",
                  "value": "Your_Client_Secret",
                  "description": "(Required) Confidential key used alongside the client_id to securely authenticate the application making the request."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "authenticatorId",
                  "value": "Siemens.TCPCM.AuthenticationMethod.TcPCM",
                  "description": "TcPCM authentication method to be used with the provided credentials."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "username",
                  "value": "Administrator",
                  "description": "TcPCM or Windows user name depending on the authenticatorId."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "password",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "Corresponding password of the username."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "subject_token_type",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Type of the token to be exchanged for the login. Only \"urn:ietf:params:oauth:token-type:access_token\" is supported."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "subject_token",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Value of the exchanged token."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "tcpcmSessionKey",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Session identifier that can be obtained via the TcPCM client application plugin."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "refresh_token",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Refresh token that you obtained via the initial authentication."
                }
              ]
            }
          },
